# VFS Products Page Architecture Sprint

**Goal:** Implement clean, professional data architecture for products page with VFS-first data fetching
**Deadline:** 28 03 2026 14:00 (90 minutes remaining)
**Status:** Critical path for MVP

---

## Regression Risk Analysis

### At-Risk Code Areas

| Area | File | Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------|------|------------|
| Category Page | `[...category]/page.tsx` | Complete rewrite | Regression test before/after |
| Root Products Page | `products/page.tsx` | Uses same data layer | Verify no breakage |
| Product Card | `ProductCard.tsx` | Used across site | Keep component unchanged |
| Data Layer | `getSelectedProducts.ts` | Still used elsewhere | Keep function, create new VFS version |
| VFS Functions | `data/catalogue.ts` | Foundation functions | Verify unchanged |
| URL Structure | Catch-all route | SEO critical | Verify 301 redirects work |

### Test Coverage Required

- [ ] `tests/vfs-data-fidelity.test.ts` - Verify VFS path works (EXISTS)
- [ ] `tests/products-page.regression.test.ts` - Verify products display
- [ ] Manual: All 12 working categories fetch correct products

---

## Scope Contract 1: Foundation - VFS Data Layer

**Objective:** Create clean VFS-first product fetching function
**Timebox:** 20 minutes

### Allowed
- Create `getProductsByCatalogSlot.ts` in `sanity/lib/products/`
- Use existing `unrollDescendantKeys` from `data/catalogue.ts`
- Use existing GROQ pattern from `getProductsByVfsKeys.ts`

### Forbidden
- Modify existing `getSelectedProducts.ts`
- Modify existing `getProductsByVfsKeys.ts`
- Add filters, sorting, pagination to VFS query

### DoD Sequence

#### Layer 1 — Structure (5 min)
- [ ] Create `sanity/lib/products/getProductsByCatalogSlot.ts`
- [ ] Define function signature: `(slotSlug: string) => Promise<Product[]>`
- [ ] Import dependencies: `resolveSlugToId`, `unrollDescendantKeys`, `sanityFetch`

#### Layer 2 — Layout (5 min)
- [ ] Implement data flow: slug → id → keys → products
- [ ] Handle edge cases: missing slug returns empty array
- [ ] Add development logging for debugging

#### Layer 3 — Surface (5 min)
- [ ] Add JSDoc comments explaining VFS resolution
- [ ] Ensure proper TypeScript types

#### Layer 4 — Interaction (5 min)
- [ ] No interaction layer (pure data function)

**Verification:**
```bash
npx tsx scripts/vfs-query-products.mjs open-back
# Verify: Returns products matching catalog slot
```

---

## Scope Contract 2: Category Page - Data Pass

**Objective:** Rewrite `[...category]/page.tsx` to use VFS-first architecture
**Timebox:** 25 minutes

### Allowed
- Rewrite `page.tsx` as clean Server Component
- Use `getProductsByCatalogSlot()` from Scope 1
- Parallel fetching with `Promise.all()`
- Separate data fetching from UI rendering

### Forbidden
- Add filters/sorting/pagination in this scope
- Change URL routing structure
- Modify existing UI components (ProductCard, etc)
- Use client-side data fetching

### DoD Sequence

#### Layer 1 — Structure (8 min)
- [ ] Clean page.tsx with clear data flow
- [ ] Import `getProductsByCatalogSlot`
- [ ] Import existing UI components (ProductCard, etc)

#### Layer 2 — Layout (8 min)
- [ ] Server Component async function
- [ ] Parallel data fetching:
  ```typescript
  const [products, categoryMetadata] = await Promise.all([
    getProductsByCatalogSlot(slug),
    getCategoryMetadata(slug) // if needed
  ]);
  ```
- [ ] Pass data to UI components

#### Layer 3 — Surface (5 min)
- [ ] Development logging for verification
- [ ] Error boundary handling

#### Layer 4 — Interaction (4 min)
- [ ] Verify ProductCard receives correct props

**Verification:**
```bash
# Manual test
open http://localhost:3000/products/headphones/open-back
# Verify: Products displayed match category
```

---

## Scope Contract 3: Root Products Page

**Objective:** Ensure `products/page.tsx` continues working
**Timebox:** 10 minutes

### Allowed
- Verify existing page works with VFS changes
- Minor adjustments if needed

### Forbidden
- Major rewrite
- Changing data fetching pattern unless broken

### DoD Sequence

#### Layer 1 — Structure (3 min)
- [ ] Review current `products/page.tsx`
- [ ] Verify imports still valid

#### Layer 2 — Layout (3 min)
- [ ] Test page loads without errors

#### Layer 3 — Surface (2 min)
- [ ] Verify all products display

#### Layer 4 — Interaction (2 min)
- [ ] Verify navigation works

**Verification:**
```bash
open http://localhost:3000/products
# Verify: All products display (no filters applied)
```

---

## Scope Contract 4: Regression Testing

**Objective:** Verify no regressions across all 12 working categories
**Timebox:** 20 minutes

### Allowed
- Run VFS data fidelity test
- Manual verification of each category
- Screenshot comparison

### Forbidden
- New feature development
- UI improvements

### DoD Sequence

#### Layer 1 — Structure (5 min)
- [ ] Run automated test: `npx vitest run tests/vfs-data-fidelity.test.ts`
- [ ] Verify 6 categories pass

#### Layer 2 — Layout (10 min)
- [ ] Manual verification checklist:
  - [ ] /products/headphones/open-back → shows open-back headphones
  - [ ] /products/headphones/closed-back → shows closed-back headphones
  - [ ] /products/audio-electronics/desktop-amps → shows desktop amps
  - [ ] /products/audio-electronics/portable-amps → shows portable amps
  - [ ] /products/accessories/earpads → shows earpads
  - [ ] /products/accessories/adapters → shows adapters (or empty)

#### Layer 3 — Surface (3 min)
- [ ] Screenshot each category for visual record

#### Layer 4 — Interaction (2 min)
- [ ] Verify navigation between categories works

**Verification:**
```bash
npm run build
# Verify: Build completes without errors
```

